# Sentry error reporting. A DSN is a write-only ingest endpoint and is public by
# design — it ships in the client bundle regardless of where it is stored, and
# grants no read access to the project. Removing this line disables Sentry
# entirely; src/lib/analytics/sentry.ts is gated on it.
#
# The ingest host must also be present in the CSP connect-src in vercel.json, or
# the browser blocks every event and Sentry silently receives nothing.
